# Desolace, Alliance ~31.5 to ~33.5: Nijel's Point and the Reclaimers, the
# Malem family, Azore's sceptre, the Gizelton caravan and the Kodo Graveyard,
# then the Kolkar for Melkins.
#
# Flow: Ironforge -> Menethil -> boat to Auberdine -> Astranaar -> Talondeep
# Path -> Nijel's Point -> Sargeron and the Malem chest -> Azore and Thunder
# Axe Fortress -> Kormek's Hut and the caravan -> Smeed and the Kodo
# Graveyard -> the Kolkar -> hearth to Nijel's Point.
# Next guide: Ashenvale.
#
# Forever above level 30 cannot be checked in game until launch on 4
# November: the Forever additions here come from the data (Questie Forever,
# Wowhead Forever), not from play.
# Left out: Bloom of the Heavens (98209, Forever, to Thundris Windweaver in
# Auberdine): Sylessa in Menethil offers it only after her first Bloom of the
# Heavens (98208), which 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills cannot place.
# Deviations from the simulator route (consensus, Alliance Human):
# - Azore's Sceptre of Light is taken on the way to Thunder Axe Fortress and
#   done together with Tyranis, instead of a separate trip from Nijel's Point
#   later.
# - The route's mid-zone hearth to Nijel's Point (for Vahlarriel, Melkins and
#   Kreldig) is dropped: those three are turned in after the closing hearth,
#   which saves a walk across the zone and back.
# - Bodyguard for Hire (5821) is optional: the Kolkar ambushers are 34-35 and
#   come in waves at about 32.
# Dropped: Strange Alliance (1382) and Brutal Politics (1385) with the rest of
# the centaur war (1384, 1386, 1369, 1370, 1373 Ongeku): Friendly with the
# Gelkis comes only from killing Magram and the reverse, so one character
# cannot serve both, and the route builds neither standing. Gizmo for Warug
# (1371) and Khan Shaka (1375) go with them. Forever's follow-ups to the war
# (A Conqueror's Crown 92743, Valley of Bones 92841 and 93034, and the
# Shen'dralas quests 92844, 93035, 93037, 93041, 93128) need Friendly or
# Honored with the Magram or the Gelkis (Wowhead Forever quest=92841: Magram
# Honored), so they are left out too; see 30-40/06-badlands.
# Class quests: Warlocks pick up the Heartswood (1738) north-west of
# Astranaar on the way to the Talondeep Path; Gakin takes it in Stormwind
# (30-40/05-arathi-highlands). Warlocks with What Is Love? (65602, the
# incubus, optional, from Takar in 07-thousand-needles) also pick up the
# Wooden Figurine on that detour (Ashenvale 26.6,22.0, Questie Forever object
# 375544); Gakin takes it at the same Stormwind stop. Forever data, not play:
# forever/class/warlock/incubus-alliance has the whole chain.
guide forever/alliance/30-40/02-desolace
title Desolace
faction Alliance
levels 31-34
zone Desolace
next forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Getting there

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  fly "Menethil Harbor"               -- From Ironforge's Gryth Thurden

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip Take the boat to Auberdine from Menethil's docks.
  fly "Astranaar"

step Heartswood
  only Warlock
  zone Ashenvale
  tip From Astranaar ride north-west into the hills: the Heartswood is a glowing tree north of the road to Maestra's Post. If you took What Is Love?, the Wooden Figurine lies in a house among the trees north of Maestra's Post (26.6,22.0). Then back past Astranaar to the Talondeep Path.
  collect 6912 quest 1738.1               -- Heartswood
  collect 190309 quest 65602.1 optional   -- Wooden Figurine, north of Maestra's Post

step The Talondeep Path
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip From Astranaar head south-west to the Talondeep Path, a tunnel through the mountains into Stonetalon.
  goto 69.9,50.5 "Windshear Crag" r 60

step Nijel's Point
  zone Desolace
  tip Follow the road west past Sun Rock Retreat (Horde) and south-west through the Charred Vale into Desolace; Nijel's Point stands at the top of the pass.
  getfp "Nijel's Point" npc 6706      -- Baritanas Skyriver
  sethome "Nijel's Point" npc 11103   -- Innkeeper Lyshaerya
  turnin 1453                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  accept 1458
  accept 1437                         -- Vahlarriel Demonslayer
  accept 1387                         -- Corporal Melkins

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east

step Sargeron
  tip The Hatefury satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron, east of Nijel's Point.
  collect 6246 quest 1458.1           -- Hatefury Claw
  collect 6247 quest 1458.2           -- Hatefury Horn

step Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1458
  accept 1459

step Malem chest
  tip The chest lies in the ruins south-west of Nijel's Point.
  turnin 1437                         -- Malem Chest
  accept 1465

step Vahlarriel Demonslayer
  turnin 1465
  accept 1438

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Axe Fortress

step Azore Aldamort
  tip Azore's tower stands on the hill west of Thunder Axe Fortress: take his quest first, the sceptre he wants is in the fortress.
  accept 5741

step Dalinda Malem
  tip Dalinda hides inside the Burning Blade's fortress south-west of Nijel's Point.
  turnin 1438
  accept 1439

step Tyranis and the Seer
  tip Her brother Tyranis (36) walks the fortress with the Burning Blade cultists (30-33): pull him alone. The Burning Blade Seer keeps the sceptre in the fortress's main building.
  collect 6767 quest 1439             -- Tyranis' Pendant
  collect 15750 quest 5741            -- Sceptre of Light

step Escort Dalinda
  turnin 1439                         -- Dalinda Malem
  accept 1440
  goto 58.3,30.9 "Out of Thunder Axe Fortress"
  note Lead Dalinda out of the fortress; she walks off once you are clear of it. Vahlarriel takes the turn-in at Nijel's Point at the end of the guide.
  complete 1440

step Azore Aldamort
  turnin 5741

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kormek's Hut and the caravan

step Scorpashi venom
  tip The Scorpashi scorpids hunt the hills around Kormek's Hut on the road south.
  collect 6248 quest 1459.1           -- Scorpashi Venom

step Cork Gizelton
  tip The Gizelton Caravan waits at Kormek's Hut.
  accept 5821 optional

step Escort the caravan
  tip Walk with the caravan south past Kolkar Village; Kolkar ambushers jump it on the way. Stay close until it stops at Scrabblescrew's Camp. The ambushers are 34-35 and come in waves: skip it if you are below 33.
  complete 5821 optional

step Smeed Scrabblescrew
  tip Smeed's camp is on the road south of Kolkar Village, by the Kodo Graveyard.
  turnin 5821 optional
  accept 5561

step Kodo Graveyard
  tip Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged Kodo and walk the tamed kodo back to his camp, five times; Aged Kodos also drop the hides.
  complete 5561
  collect 6249 quest 1459.2           -- Aged Kodo Hide

step Smeed Scrabblescrew
  turnin 5561

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Kolkar

step Kolkar Village
  tip The Kolkar roam the plains around Kolkar Village; their ears are for Corporal Melkins.
  collect 6067 quest 1387             -- Centaur Ear

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nijel's Point

step Nijel's Point
  hearth "Nijel's Point"
  turnin 1440                         -- Vahlarriel Demonslayer
  turnin 1387                         -- Corporal Melkins
  turnin 1459                         -- Kreldig Ungor
